				<br>
				Pre-registration is required by all IBS competitors prior to one week before the IBS Match dates.
<br>
Pre-registration is not required for the PTRC Club Matches.
<br>
Pre-registration will assure entry for the IBS Matches as they will be <u><b>limited to 50 competitors</b></u>
<br>
Send no funds as they will be collected at sign-in the morning of the match.
<br>
You must pre-register by email or by US Mail prior to one week before the match.
